{
 "android-feedback|Snackbar": {
  "summary": "A Plenix snackbar on Android is the Material 3 Snackbar in a SnackbarHost, kept native in behavior (timing, swipe to dismiss, one action, the TalkBack announcement) and styled with the Plenix toast tokens: a 4 dp rounded bar in the toast color with a 3 dp tone edge at the start, a tone icon, DM Sans text at the secondary role and an action at the label role. Info, success and warning leave after 4 seconds; danger stays until dismissed. Material’s default is an inverse-surface bar with an inverse-primary action; Plenix keeps Material’s structure and replaces the look.",
